@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Face Registration & Recognition Login

DEVELOPER OWNER: Ahmad
MODULE: Authentication & Biometrics
TRELLO TASK: Face Registration & Recognition Login
TRELLO URL: Not provided — add from the Trello board

PURPOSE:
Enrollment page for face-recognition sign-in; the sign-in
entry point is on the Login page.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Any signed-in user (enrolls their own account)

ROUTE: /Biometrics/Face

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Decide the face recognition provider and liveness method.
- Implement enrollment and verification server-side; audit
  attempts.
- Enable the Login page button only when real verification
  works.

DEPENDENCIES:
AspNetUsers, future biometric credential table, Login page,
AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
No image-based fake authentication.
